**/.idea/
**/target/

# Playwright output from the example suites. Each example config states its own `outputDir` (the
# artefact directory) AND its own html reporter `outputFolder`, both under that example's own
# directory, so traces, failure artefacts and the html report all land here rather than in the
# repo root's. The root .gitignore's `/test-results/` and `/playwright-report/` are anchored to
# the repo root and do not reach a nested path — mirrored here the way
# packages/galvanized-pukeko-vue-ui/.gitignore already mirrors it for that package.
#
# Neither pattern below decides where anything goes; they ignore output where it already lands,
# and it lands here only because those two keys in each config say so. Remove either key and the
# output returns to the repo root — where the root patterns cover it just as quietly, and an
# example run again destroys the root harness's report or results.json with nothing to show for
# it. The configs are what to check if these patterns ever look like they match nothing.
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
